## Scope of this license

The MIT license above covers the CODE of the Aspectie Design System: the CSS,
the JavaScript, the TypeScript, the framework ports under `packages/`, the
build and verification tooling under `tools/` and `scripts/`, the written
documentation under `ads-rules/` and `specs/`, and the documentation site
itself.

It does NOT cover two other kinds of file, which carry their own terms:

1. **Visual assets of the Aspectie brand and of this design system** - the
   brand symbol and wordmark, the illustrations, the sharing images and any
   icon drawn for the ADS itself. Those are licensed under Creative Commons
   Attribution 4.0 International. See `LICENSE-ASSETS`.

2. **Third-party fonts and icon families redistributed inside this
   repository** - three type families under `fonts/` and five icon families
   under `icons/`. Each keeps the license of whoever made it, and the full
   text of every one of those licenses is in `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`. The
   font licenses also travel next to the font files, as the SIL Open Font
   License requires.

If you are only consuming the design system in a product, the short version
is: the code is MIT, credit the design, and keep the third-party notices for
the fonts and icons you ship.
